prompt:
A real photograph of a small amateur football pitch in a Berlin park on a sunny Saturday morning, taken as a teammate standing on the grass a few metres away would take it with a good phone camera, in a tall vertical picture, everything in sharp focus. Natural colours, bright morning sun, a blue sky with a few white clouds. The textures of real grass, net, metal, fabric, leather, plastic, wood and skin.

The first reference picture shows the young man from the front, the second in three-quarter view: his face, his short hair, his build and his height stay exactly as in them. Use them for the person only; his clothes here are a plain green football shirt with short sleeves, black shorts, white socks and black football boots.

Every thing on the pitch stands on its own, with a little space around it, so that the eye can tell at once where each thing is. Nothing in the picture carries any writing, numbers or print: the shirts have no numbers and no names, the flags are plain, and nothing carries a logo or a sign.

THE FRONT of the picture, the lower part, is short green grass with a white line painted on it:
- a black-and-white leather football lying on the grass;
- a black sports bag lying open on the grass, with a white towel and a bottle of water with no label sticking out of it;
- a pair of old white trainers next to the bag;
- three orange plastic cones in a row on the grass.

THE YOUNG MAN of the reference pictures stands on the grass, seen whole from his head to his boots, which stand on the grass with their shadow beside them. He is caught just after scoring: one fist raised in the air, his mouth open in a happy shout, a little out of breath.

THE MIDDLE of the picture:
- a white football goal with its net, a little to the left, with a ball caught in the back of the net;
- the goalkeeper, a young man in a plain yellow shirt and black gloves, sits in the grass in front of the goal, laughing;
- on the right, the coach, a woman of about forty-five with short dark hair, in a grey tracksuit, with a silver whistle on a cord round her neck, claps her hands;
- two teammates in plain green shirts run towards the young man.

THE BACK of the picture:
- a small red corner flag on a thin pole at the corner of the pitch;
- a long wooden bench where a few spectators sit, an older man with a flat cap and a young woman with a pram;
- a bicycle leaning against a low green metal fence;
- tall trees of the park in summer, and a round white clock on a pole with a plain face and no numbers;
- above, the blue sky with a few white clouds.
